'''Sairi Nijitani''' (虹谷彩理) is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Power Pro Baseball Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 6.8 Update|Version 6.8]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Sairi Nijitani
|image = E 383.png
|appearance = [[Power Pro Baseball Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 1,800¢ - 7,110¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy has somewhat high health and damage, but low DPS and mediocre range being her main weaknesses. However, she also has an [[Omni Strike]] that increases her range to a number being able to hit most mid-range attackers, as well as a 100% chance to [[Weaken]] units to 50% of their original attack power.

==Strategy==
Like mentioned before, this enemy's main weakeness is its low range even with its Omni Strike which means any unit with above 350 range like [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] will be able to safely chip away at it. Another option is to use Rushers like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] to quickly dispose of it since its attack power and attack rate are very mediocre.

